0..76 Comment "// Two reflexivities whose points no rule relates are not one path: the twin"
77..149 Comment "// of the model\'s `peak_is_here` (the HoTT book\'s § 1.12, `refl`, under"
150..223 Comment "// judgmental equality). `S(x)` and `P(x)` share no normal form under the"
224..288 Comment "// integers\' cancellations, so `Path.here(P(x))` is no path from"
289..309 Comment "// `S(x)` to `S(x)`."
